WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.066
Chris Stewart, thanks for talking to Reason.

00:01:28.066 --> 00:01:30.080
Hey, thanks for having me, Nick. I appreciate it. 

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:34.202
Let's start by talking about the past year in&nbsp;
K -12 education. 

00:01:34.202 --> 00:01:39.454
I am glad both that I was not a student nor my children are out of&nbsp;K-12.

00:01:39.454 --> 00:01:41.988
So like, I am glad I didn't have to deal&nbsp; with this. 

00:01:41.988 --> 00:01:47.200
I know you did, but what are the&nbsp;
essential lessons that we should be learning

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:52.003
from the COVID-19 lockdowns about K-12 education?

00:01:52.003 --> 00:01:56.160
Well I think one of the most important lessons that we 

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:02.720
all learned as parents, those of us who have&nbsp;
kids in the K-12 system, is that government is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:08.000
not always going to be reliable for us. So this&nbsp;
was the first time in mass that government gave us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.850
our kids back and said, here have at her, because&nbsp;
we have nothing for you right now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:19.360
And it was the first time for many parents that they encountered&nbsp;the idea that, whoa, wow, I am entirely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.759
responsible for these young people in my house.&nbsp;

00:02:22.759 --> 00:02:28.529
And it may have been the first time they had to exercise muscles as parents that they haven't had to exercise before,

00:02:28.529 --> 00:02:35.528
because for so many years&nbsp;education has professionalized parents out of the educational equation. 

00:02:35.528 --> 00:02:36.720
And over periods of time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:42.160
it has infantilized parents to the point where&nbsp;we can't even imagine being responsible totally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:43.944
for our kids' education.

00:02:43.944 --> 00:02:48.735
And in this last year&nbsp;became abundantly clear government had nothing for us.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:54.160
They said basically, we'll get back to you.&nbsp;
Right? Here's your kids, we’ll get back to you.

